<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:04:56 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>'4' #照片建议</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa007f5123dc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;'4' #照片建议&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A stairwell with a glass wall and roof. ‘4’s’ of various sizes, in black, are scattered across the wall, and a large ‘4’ on the wall inside is also visible. The surroundings are reflected in the glass, making the image seem a little unsettling. The image is in black and white. " height="2448" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa007f5123dc.jpg" width="2684"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:04:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>位于柏林的Romeo und Romeo的彩虹蛋糕</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9fe505f1218</link><description>&lt;p&gt;位于柏林的Romeo und Romeo的彩虹蛋糕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the rainbow cake at Romeo und Romeo in Berlin" height="1768" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/yuko/6a9fe505f1218.png" width="1769"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://yuko.some.pics"&gt;@yuko&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 10:35:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>🚶🏻模拟通勤</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9fbb0c67400</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🚶🏻模拟通勤&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An forest path winding through dense green trees and foliage, with a dirt trail scattered with fallen leaves and sunlight filtering through the canopy. In the lower-right corner are blue decorative elements—a walking-person icon in a blue circle and a large turquoise outline of a winding path—along with a pale blue banner at the bottom edge that reads “edegem # 2,4 km.”" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a9fbb0c67400.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 07:36:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今天在这条木板路上跑步时我有点紧张，因为路面覆盖物挺多的。我可能得带着我的割草机去清理一下这些步道，帮市政分担一点。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9f2b95f1b8e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天在这条木板路上跑步时我有点紧张，因为路面覆盖物挺多的。我可能得带着我的割草机去清理一下这些步道，帮市政分担一点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A narrow path cuts through tall green marsh grasses towards a distant treeline under a cloudy sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a9f2b95f1b8e.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 21:24:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>照片拼贴</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9f1e467ffbc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;照片拼贴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Collage of photos" height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/chrisod/6a9f1e467ffbc.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://chrisod.some.pics"&gt;@chrisod&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 20:27:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周一足球之夜</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9efb599543a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;⚽️ 周一晚上的足球。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="⚽️ Voetbal op maandagavond. " height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a9efb599543a.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 17:58:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>...新的联盟是如何建立的？</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9edac61ddf6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;...新的联盟是如何建立的？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The three wicker chairs are standing in the corner, but the one that Was previously a bit further away, is now turned towards the one on the left and almost touching it.
For the rest of the stories about the chairs,  see: https://roteskuffen.weblog.lol/2026/06/a-two-way-conversation-with-observation" height="2948" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9edac61ddf6.jpg" width="2910"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 15:39:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a9eda8054f63</link><description>&lt;p&gt;周日静默&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An almost ripe red and yellow apple, from which raindrops from the night are dripping, hangs amongst green leaves." height="2206" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9eda8054f63.jpg" width="2206"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 15:38:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>晨光里的第一杯咖啡</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ed9f7cac79</link><description>&lt;p&gt;第一杯咖啡带着一丝阳光的味道……祝你今天过得愉快。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="On a blue tablecloth with a floral pattern stands a cup that is beige on the inside and features a turquoise and white pattern on the outside. The cup is filled with coffee, and a hint of sunlight can be seen on the rim, along with the reflection of a bright square … from the window of the neighbouring room." height="2432" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ed9f7cac79.jpg" width="2192"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 15:36:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>窗户星期五</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9ed9903165e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Fenster Freitag&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An old double-glazed window, once painted white, with rusty hinges and partially broken glass in the inner pane, in which the green wilderness opposite is reflected." height="4000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a9ed9903165e.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 15:34:45 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>